//! Accumulators of a known width, in lowest terms by construction.
//!
//! Each is a power of three over a power of five, so numerator and denominator share no factor and
//! the width is exactly what the name says rather than whatever a reduction happened to leave.

/// `3^40 / 5^27`, one word on a 64 bit target.
pub const W1: &str = "12157665459056928801/7450580596923828125";

